{"tool":"medusa.admin_post","args":{"path":"/admin/research/artifacts","body":{"record_type":"report","scope_id":"rscope_colander_supply","save_key":"colander-supply-es-2000-r1","schema_revision":"product_supplier_research/1","report_kind":"product_supplier_research","skill_revision":"intgral-research/supplier@2","runbook_revision":"intgral-research@4","template_revision":"product_supplier_research@1","markdown":"# 硅胶沥水篮供应商比较（2000 件，发西班牙）\n\n范围：rscope_colander_supply。三家候选，证据观察日期 2026-09-05（挂牌）、2026-09-10（报价）。\n\n## 结论：哪家最便宜？现有证据下无法确定\n\n| 供应商 | 价格数字 | 状态 | 可比性 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| A（70001，product 90001） | 报价 USD 1.28/件，FOB Ningbo，2000 件，24 cm 灰色，含 logo 印刷、polybag，有效期至 2026-10-10 | 范围明确的报价（quote:70001:Q-2026-091，rart_quote_a） | 唯一带贸易条款的数字，仅 FOB，仅 24 cm |\n| A 挂牌 | 2000-4999 档 US $1.30/件 | 挂牌观察，待核实（[alibaba:product:90001](https://example.test/product/90001)，rart_ali_prod_a） | 贸易条款未知 |\n| B（70002，product 90002） | 1000-2999 档 US $1.15/件 | 挂牌观察，待核实（[alibaba:product:90002](https://example.test/product/90002)，rart_ali_prod_b） | 贸易条款未知，无报价 |\n| C（70003，product 90003） | 1000-2999 档 CN¥16.5/套 | 挂牌观察，待核实（[alibaba:product:90003](https://example.test/product/90003)，rart_ali_prod_c） | 币种（人民币）和单位（套，2 件装）都不同，未换算 |\n\n- B 的数字最低（1.15），但它是未知贸易条款的挂牌价，没有报价，不能和 A 的 FOB 报价比较。\n- C 是人民币、按套计价；套内内容和尺寸没有证据，不换算成美元/件。\n- 到岸成本无法计算：缺运费（宁波到西班牙）、关税、增值税、验货、包装确认。任何部分小计都不是到岸成本，因此 cost_scenario 为 null。\n- 所以“哪家最便宜”目前只能回答：A 是唯一可比的一个数字（FOB 1.28 USD），B 的挂牌数字更低但基础不明，C 无法比较。先让三家按同一基础报价再比。\n\n## 其他条款（均为待核实）\n\n- 起订量：A 500 件，B 1000 件，C 300 套（均为挂牌）。\n- 交期：A 挂牌 2000 件以内 25 天、2001-5000 件 35 天；A 报价 30-35 天（收到定金后起算），两者冲突，计划应以报价为准（它写明了起算条件），挂牌值保留。B 30 天（3000 件以内），C 20 天（1000 套以内），起算条件均未知。\n- 样品：三家挂牌均称可提供、7-10 天，样品价格未列；A 报价样品 2 件 USD 15，7 天。\n- 资质：A、C 有平台 Verified Supplier 徽章和 isFactory:true，B 为 isFactory:false。这些只是平台标签，不证明工厂能力；三家能力均未核实。\n- A 报价 2026-10-10 到期，今天 2026-10-07，仅剩 3 天。\n- 报价只覆盖 24 cm；26 cm 无报价。\n\n## 排名与处置\n\n不选供应商，不联系，不下样。三家均为 hold_for_evidence：A 有可用报价但能力未核实且仅 FOB；B 需要同基础报价；C 需确认是否可供单件、尺寸及币种基础。\n\n## RFQ 草稿（未发送）\n\n见 data.rfq。\n","data":{"opportunity_ref":"silicone-colander-suppliers-es","criteria":[{"id":"fit","applies_to":"product","importance":"must_have","description":"24-26 cm collapsible silicone colander"},{"id":"capability","applies_to":"supplier","importance":"must_have","description":"Evidence of silicone manufacturing capability"}],"commercial_basis":{"intended_quantity":2000,"currency":null,"destination":"ES","trade_terms":null,"cost_basis":"one scoped FOB quote (supplier 70001, 24 cm only) plus listing tiers of unknown trade terms; listings differ in currency and unit","cost_scenario":null,"unknown_cost_components":["freight Ningbo to ES","duty","VAT","inspection","packaging confirmation","trade terms of listing tiers (B, C)","quotes from B and C","C set contents and per-piece equivalent"]},"products":[{"id":"product-90001","supplier_id":"supplier-70001","original_source_ref":"alibaba:product:90001","evidence_id":"rart_ali_prod_a","observed_at":"2026-09-05T08:10:00.000Z","variant_interpretation":"foldable silicone colander with handles, 24 cm and 26 cm","specs":[],"price_tiers":[{"amount":1.45,"currency":"US $","unit":"piece","min_quantity":500,"max_quantity":1999,"source_variant":"90001-24","offer_basis":"unknown","value_basis":"observed","evidence_id":"rart_ali_prod_a","source_ref":"alibaba:product:90001","observed_at":"2026-09-05T08:10:00.000Z"},{"amount":1.3,"currency":"US $","unit":"piece","min_quantity":2000,"max_quantity":4999,"source_variant":"90001-24","offer_basis":"unknown","value_basis":"observed","evidence_id":"rart_ali_prod_a","source_ref":"alibaba:product:90001","observed_at":"2026-09-05T08:10:00.000Z"}],"gaps":["listing trade terms unknown","26 cm not quoted"],"criterion_outcomes":[{"criterion_id":"fit","outcome":"evidence_supports","reason":"Listing is a foldable silicone colander in 24 and 26 cm","evidence_ids":["rart_ali_prod_a"]}]},{"id":"product-90002","supplier_id":"supplier-70002","original_source_ref":"alibaba:produc